# Gitignored files copied into each new `claude --worktree` checkout (gitignore syntax).
# Not processed at all if a WorktreeCreate hook is ever added - that hook replaces the
# built-in git worktree logic, copying included.

# Carries TURBO_CACHE_DIR and NODE_COMPILE_CACHE, so a worktree shares the warm caches
# instead of rebuilding both from cold. Keep this file free of secrets: it propagates.

# Deliberately absent: .dev.vars, .env*, and every other credential file. A worktree gets
# its own provisioned credentials - see AGENTS.md "Environment". Copying real secrets into
# every worktree is what .claude/rules/core/guardrails.md exists to prevent.
# Also absent: hooks/logs/ (the hooks mkdir -p it) and dist/ / .wrangler/ (build outputs).
